  "lockedIn": [],
  "text": [
    "Take over pauses the replay and asks whom you play. The game can start again only where the recording keeps a whole world, every 10 s, so the replay first goes back to the last such moment.",
    "From there the game is live and the player you chose is yours. What you play is a fork, a timeline of its own that the recording keeps; the Forks bay lists the forks, a lane each over the track, to watch, save as a replay of its own, or delete. A recording keeps at most three: a fourth replaces the one watched least recently.",
    "In the game the other players become computer players after a takeover; here they play on as recorded. Every timeline stops at 1:30, a fork of your own in Try it yourself too."
  ],
